    {
      "id": "p0195-b003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "As we've seen, not every version of Under tale is the same - for example, the PlayStation 4 version has content not found in the Nintendo Switch version, and vice-versa. These differences range in size, from secret rooms with new content to minor text changes that rely on alternate programming.",
        "raw": "As we've seen, not every version of Under tale is the same - for example, the\nPlayStation 4 version has content not found in the Nintendo Switch version,\nand vice-versa. These differences range in size, from secret rooms with new\ncontent to minor text changes that rely on alternate programming.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.09008476,
          0.23819286,
          0.67362339,
          0.30559286
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.08805216,
          0.23747857,
          0.70159195,
          0.30666429
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          20,
          21,
          22,
          23
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "我们已经看到，《Undertale》的各版本并不完全相同。例如 PlayStation 4 版有 Nintendo Switch 版没有的内容，反过来也一样。差别有大有小，从装着新内容的隐藏房间，到因程序不同而产生的细微文字变化。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": [
