    {
      "id": "p0195-b005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "What's more, each time Toby adds new content or fixes a bug, all of these separate versions need to be updated, which can lead to even more versions to keep track of. All of this illustrates how game localization can be an ongoing process rather than a one-and-done affair.",
        "raw": "What's more, each time Toby adds new content or fixes a bug, all of these\nseparate versions need to be updated, which can lead to even more versions to\nkeep track of. All of this illustrates how game localization can be an ongoing\nprocess rather than a one-and-done affair.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.09054209,
          0.44,
          0.69129684,
          0.50808571
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.08805216,
          0.43928571,
          0.70159195,
          0.50915714
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          30,
          31,
          32,
          33
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "而且，每次 Toby 增添内容或修复错误，都得更新各个版本，这又可能产生更多需要追踪的版本。这说明游戏本地化可以是一项持续的工作，而非一次交付就结束。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
